body:
- King {Brandon the Builder}, also known as Boris, legendary founder of House Volkonsky, built Anfield and erected the Sudtribune, established the Anfield Guard, rumored first King in the Camp Nou District.
- King {Brandon Volkonsky}, King in the Camp Nou District, called "Brandon the Breaker", united with King {Joramun} to defeat the Night's King and his corpse queen and free the Anfield Guard.
- King {Rodrik Volkonsky}, King in the Camp Nou District, wrestled the Ironborn for the control of Bear Island and gave it to House Mamonov.
- King {Dorren Volkonsky}
- King {Ivan Volkonsky}
- King {Gleb Volkonsky}
- King {Timofey Volkonsky}
- Lord {Karlon Volkonsky}, founder of House Vyazemsky (then called House Volkonsky of Karlon's Hold) after putting down a rebellion of House Baryatinsky of the Dreadfort.
- {Osric Volkonsky}, elected Lord Commander of the Anfield Guard at the age of 10\.
- King {Torrhen Volkonsky}, called "The King Who Knelt", the last King in the Camp Nou District, who bent the knee to King {Aegon Romanov}.
- Lord {Alexei Volkonsky}, Lord of Anfield and Keeper of Camp Nou District. Head of House Volkonsky during the reign of Viserys I Romanov.
	- Lord {Cregan Volkonsky}, his son. Lord of Anfield and Keeper of Camp Nou District. Fought Prince {Akim Romanov the Dragonknight}.
- An {unnamed member}, buried in the crypts beneath Anfield. Raised as wight during the Camp Nou Derby.
